---
description: Orbit actor file conventions.
globs:
  - "**/*.actor.ts"
---

- Use explicit '@Actor("Name")' identifiers.
- Define a const message map (for example, 'const ROOM_MESSAGES = defineActorMessages(...)') and reference it from '@Handle(...)'.
- Align actor names with worker DO exports and wrangler class_name bindings.
- Use '.js' suffix on relative imports in TS ESM source files.
